<form class="totalform help-on-hover help-box" data-method="POST" data-route="/admin/settings/imageworks"><div class="form-field toggle-field " data-type="toggle" style="--grid-area: gatherLocation;"><label for="field-UID">Gather Image Location Data</label><div class="form-group"><div class="switch"><input id="field-UID" name="gatherLocation" type="checkbox" aria-describedby="help-UID" checked/><label for="field-UID" aria-hidden="true">Gather Image Location Data</label></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Extract GPS coordinates and location metadata (latitude, longitude, altitude, country, state, city, sublocation) from uploaded images. Non-location EXIF data (camera, lens, exposure, author, copyright, date) is always preserved. Disable for GDPR compliance and privacy protection.</p></div><div class="form-field text-field " data-type="text" style="--grid-area: watermarksGallery;"><label for="field-UID">Watermark Gallery</label><div class="form-group"><input type="text" id="field-UID" name="watermarksGallery" placeholder="watermarks" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="watermarks" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">The ID of the gallery where watermarks should be uploaded to. If not set, the default <code>watermarks</code> ID will be used.</p></div><div class="form-field text-field " data-type="text" style="--grid-area: watermarkFontsDepot;"><label for="field-UID">Watermark Fonts Depot</label><div class="form-group"><input type="text" id="field-UID" name="watermarkFontsDepot" placeholder="watermark-fonts" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="watermark-fonts" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">The ID of the depot where TTF font files for text watermarks should be uploaded to. If not set, the default <code>watermark-fonts</code> ID will be used.</p></div><div class="form-field json-field " data-type="json" style="--grid-area: defaults;"><label for="field-UID">ImageWorks Defaults</label><div class="form-group"><textarea id="field-UID" name="defaults" rows="8" placeholder="{&quot;fm&quot;: &quot;jpg&quot;, &quot;q&quot;: 92}" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="help-UID">{
    "fm": "jpg",
    "q": 92
}</textarea><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Default parameters applied to all image generation. Common options include format (fm), quality (q), fit, and more. See ImageWorks documentation for all available parameters.</p></div><div class="form-field json-field " data-type="json" style="--grid-area: presets;" data-settings="{&quot;rows&quot;:20}"><label for="field-UID">ImageWorks Presets</label><div class="form-group"><textarea id="field-UID" name="presets" rows="20" placeholder="{&quot;small&quot;: {&quot;w&quot;: 300, &quot;h&quot;: 200}, &quot;medium&quot;: {&quot;w&quot;: 600, &quot;h&quot;: 400}}" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="help-UID">{
    "small": {
        "w": 300,
        "h": 200
    },
    "small-crop": {
        "w": 300,
        "h": 300,
        "fit": "crop-focalpoint"
    },
    "medium": {
        "w": 600,
        "h": 400
    },
    "medium-crop": {
        "w": 600,
        "h": 600,
        "fit": "crop-focalpoint"
    }
}</textarea><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">JSON that defines presets that can be used for image generation. See the ImageWorks documentation for details on all of the parameters that can be used.</p></div><div class="form-inline-fields"><button type="submit" class="button btn cms-save cms-button">Save Settings</button></div></form>